{"version":1,"content":"<p>Meta披露的一份監管文件顯示，公司行政總裁馬克·扎克伯格曾認真考慮將自己的主要居住地遷出加利福尼亞州，以規避一項可能帶來巨額税務負擔的「億萬富翁財富税」提案。為了確保扎克伯格繼續留在公司總部所在地附近領導企業，Meta最終與其達成了一項具有裏程碑意義的安排。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583480.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:43:51.855519+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:27:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.572122+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.572122+00:00","content_hash":"19d30b5e57ba60ea1405bed8b1d5826136b799f4c9dd72643beb1dc9894bb38f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}